  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8b25316da3552ef4cb2f88d5212c1103, type: 3}
  m_Name: Log_01_Crew
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TerminalLogData
  logTitle: CREW LOG // MAINTENANCE
  author: MECH_JENKINS
  dayNumber: 12
  logPages:
  - '[SYSTEM NOTICE: EMERGENCY POWER REDIRECTION ACTIVE]


    Airlock 4''s primary
    pressure valves are completely shot. Until the engineering deck sends up a replacement
    core, I''ve engaged the magnetic safety seals to lock the frame shut. Nobody
    is getting through this entryway from the hangar floor.

'
  - 'If you''re stuck out here and need a manual bypass, don''t try forcing the console.
    You''ll just blow the terminal circuits.


    Instead, grab my industrial Fusion
    Welder. It has enough thermal output to slice right through the magnetic seal
    pins and break the door lock wide open.'
  - 'I left the welding unit secured inside one of the rusted crew lockers sitting
    across the spaceship garage floor.


    The locker''s latch is jammed up from
    old engine grease, but a firm tug should pop it open. Don''t lose my tools.'
